/Tencent/rapidjson/issues/events/14456246302","actor":{"login":"danipindado","id":22555491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTU1NDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22555491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado","html_url":"https://github.com/danipindado","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"renamed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-09-30T13:27:16Z","rename":{"from":"Wrong validation if \"additionalProperties\" has boolean value false and \"required\" is used","to":"Bug: wrong validation if \"additionalProperties\" has boolean value false"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent/rapidjson/issues/comments/2385100070","html_url":"https://github.com/Tencent/rapidjson/issues/2296#issuecomment-2385100070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent/rapidjson/issues/2296","id":2385100070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAQlhZc6OKb0m","user":{"login":"danipindado","id":22555491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTU1NDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22555491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado","html_url":"https://github.com/danipindado","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-01T08:17:34Z","updated_at":"2024-10-01T08:17:34Z","body":"i have checked out current head and i can reproduce the problem with unittest by inserting this test case in required.json, \r\n\r\n```\r\n    {\r\n        \"description\": \"bug: required properties mess up with additionalProperties handling\",\r\n        \"schema\": {\r\n            \"properties\": {\r\n                \"A\": {},\r\n                \"B\": {}\r\n            },\r\n            \"required\": [\"B\",\"C\"],\r\n            \"additionalProperties\": false\r\n        },\r\n        \"tests\": [\r\n            {\r\n                \"description\": \"invalid due to missing C\",\r\n                \"data\": {\"A\": 1,\"B\": 1},\r\n                \"valid\": false\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"description\": \"invalid due to presence of C and additionalProperties == false\",\r\n                \"data\": {\"B\": 1,\"C\": 1},\r\n                \"valid\": false\r\n            }\r\n        ]\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n`Fail: jsonschema/tests/draft4/required.json \"bug: required properties mess up with additionalProperties handling\" \"invalid due to presence of C and additionalProperties == false\"`\r\n\r\ni think the problem has to do with how properties_ array is built during schema parsing [here](https://github.com/Tencent/rapidjson/blob/5a74efa8c76e9ee7dcdf7b76478a09e774de7de6/include/rapidjson/schema.h#L653-L660). \r\nrequired properties are added to the same array, and, later, they are flagged as `required`. \r\n\r\nthe function [FindePropertyIndex](https://github.com/Tencent/rapidjson/blob/5a74efa8c76e9ee7dcdf7b76478a09e774de7de6/include/rapidjson/schema.h#L1509-L1520) which is used to see if additional properties have been added, checks the entire properties_ array. it does not check if originally the property was part of \"properties\" or \"required\". and this is the problem. because according spec, only \"properties\" and \"patternProperties\" are relevant for \"additionalProperties\" handling. \r\n\r\none would need maybe an additional member in the [Property class](https://github.com/Tencent/rapidjson/blob/5a74efa8c76e9ee7dcdf7b76478a09e774de7de6/include/rapidjson/schema.h#L1673-L1682) to see if the property was originally in \"properties\" object. \r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Tencent/rapidjson/issues/comments/2385100070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"danipindado","id":22555491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTU1NDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22555491?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado","html_url":"https://github.com/danipindado","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danipindado/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}}]